From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:36:45 +0000
Subject: joycon-switch1: Switch 1 Joy-Cons as Joy-Cons, each with its own
 motion sensor

macOS joins a Joy-Con pair into one GameController controller with no motion,
and leaves the Joy-Cons' sensors off. The pair's player now gets the Joy-Con
styles (dm_joy_attach) and each half's buttons and stick (dm_joy_set); each
Joy-Con's sensor is switched on (subcommand 0x40) and read from its report
0x30 as the Pro Controller's (motion_pro.h), the right one with y and z
negated (measured). DM_JOY1=0 keeps the old Pro-style pad.
---
